{
  "name": "Code Quality Monitor",
  "description": "Real-time code quality monitoring with compilation checks and error analysis",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "file_save",
    "patterns": [
      "**/*.ts",
      "**/*.js",
      "**/*.tsx",
      "**/*.jsx",
      "**/*.py",
      "**/*.java",
      "**/*.cpp",
      "**/*.c",
      "**/*.rs",
      "**/*.go"
    ]
  },
  "action": {
    "type": "agent_execution",
    "message": "🔍 **CODE QUALITY MONITOR ACTIVATED**\n\nFile: {{file_path}}\nLanguage: {{file_extension}}\nSize: {{file_size}} bytes\n\n**REAL-TIME ANALYSIS PROTOCOL:**\n\n1. **Compilation Check**\n   - Run language-specific compiler/interpreter\n   - Report syntax errors with line numbers and explanations\n   - Suggest fixes for common compilation issues\n\n2. **Static Code Analysis**\n   - Run ESLint/Pylint/equivalent for the language\n   - Check code style and formatting compliance\n   - Identify potential bugs and code smells\n   - Analyze cyclomatic complexity\n\n3. **Security Scanning**\n   - Scan for common security vulnerabilities\n   - Check for hardcoded secrets or credentials\n   - Analyze dependency security issues\n   - Report potential injection vulnerabilities\n\n4. **Quality Metrics**\n   - Calculate maintainability index\n   - Measure code duplication percentage\n   - Analyze function/class complexity\n   - Check naming convention compliance\n\n5. **Improvement Suggestions**\n   - Provide specific, actionable recommendations\n   - Suggest refactoring opportunities\n   - Recommend best practices for the language\n   - Link to relevant documentation\n\n**OUTPUT FORMAT:**\n```\n✅ COMPILATION: [PASS/FAIL]\n📊 QUALITY SCORE: [0-100]\n🔒 SECURITY SCORE: [0-100]\n⚡ PERFORMANCE IMPACT: [LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH]\n\n🔧 IMMEDIATE ACTIONS NEEDED:\n- [List specific issues to fix]\n\n💡 SUGGESTIONS:\n- [List improvement recommendations]\n```\n\nAnalyze the saved file and provide immediate feedback."
  },
  "conditions": [
    {
      "type": "file_size_limit",
      "max_bytes": 1048576
    },
    {
      "type": "not_in_directory",
      "patterns": ["node_modules", ".git", "dist", "build"]
    }
  ],
  "settings": {
    "enabled": true,
    "auto_approve": true,
    "timeout": 30000,
    "max_executions_per_hour": 100,
    "priority": "high",
    "debounce_ms": 1000
  }
}